pros:
Very smart people, great partnership potential across business, functional, and geographical boundaries;
Some senior managers welcome mentoring opportunities;
Ability to network within company is huge;
Job satisfaction comes from knowing you did the right thing.

cons:
Politics and bureaucracy can get in the way of being efficient, successful, even profitable;
Performance reviews are all about lip service - but ratings rarely match;
If you are a high potential individual, you are recognized only in words; you are on 99% on your own, and you have to work really hard at getting promoted.

pros:
